        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "text": "，他才会写出这样的话，所以整篇的这个毛选啊啊大家都值得去去啊",
      "timestamp": 1774408293.642974,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 11:11:33",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
