      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "text": "。那么毛泽东这这套实验这套革命啊其实是很不被理解的",
