      "datetime": "2026-03-25 11:11:42",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "text": "，当时共产国际呢啊很多人啊嘲笑他讥笑他，啊特别是自称着100%布尔什维克的王明上台",
      "timestamp": 1774408313.1007512,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 11:11:53",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "text": "，啊王明走了之后，他还传给了博古，让博古开始主持临时中央政府的这个工作。当时的共产国际说，毛泽东为代表的中国共产党人只会在山沟里打转转是",
      "timestamp": 1774408328.462513,
      "datetime": "2026-03-25 11:12:08",
      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "text": "山沟沟里的马列主义是没有读过马列主义的",
