      "speaker": "teacher",
      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "text": "，嗯那这个时候毛泽东其实是非常的落寞的，啊他",
