      "type": "recognition_interim",
      "language": "zh",
      "translation": null,
      "metadata": {
        "status": 1,
        "is_final": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "text": "很快啊他就失去了这个对于党和军队的这样一个指导权",
